cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to these drafts, please cite them as below. They are drafts, not for implementation."
type: software
title: "Selfkin: Open standards for personal AI on your own devices"
abstract: "Draft open standards for a personal AI runtime that runs on devices the user owns: Selfkin Runtimes (SK-RT), Selfkin Edge-to-Edge Communication (SK-COM), and Selfkin Provider Profiles (SK-PRV), with JSON Schemas, examples, registries, and a validator. Draft, not for implementation. No certification program exists."
